OL,3,GNEWSA'Each monster truck jump has the
OL,4,Ag-force of a car crash'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMost fathers and daughters bond over
OL,7,Fshared activities like camping and
OL,8,Fhiking but for Georgina and Tony Dixon
OL,9,Fit is their shared love of monster
OL,10,Ftrucks that brings them together.
OL,12,FMonster trucks have been part of
OL,13,F23-year-old Georgina's life since day
OL,14,Fone. Her dad bought his first monster
OL,15,Ftruck, Swamp Thing, in 2003 - the year
OL,16,Fshe was born.
OL,18,FHaving grown up with the motorsport in
OL,19,FMelksham, Wiltshire, Georgina has
OL,20,Ffollowed in her dad's footsteps and she
OL,21,Fis now thought to be the youngest
OL,22,Ffemale truck driver in the country.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
