OL,3,GNEWSA'Each monster truck jump has the
OL,4,Ag-force of a car crash'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"About two years ago, I started doing
OL,7,Fmonster trucks full-time and I love
OL,8,Fit," she said. "It's absolutely
OL,9,Famazing."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
